{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B6782104","title":"Did Alfie escape Sanguine Minds","entry":"Dlg_B6782104::entry","exit":"Dlg_B6782104::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_30119AFD","articyId":"72057645577625083","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Hey, so the results are in...","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, so the results are in...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":550.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42048","byteOffset":30233704,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_1FEAB97C","articyId":"72057645577625097","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Yeah. The bane of my life.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. The bane of my life.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1150.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18274","byteOffset":14800160,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_037F5C5A","articyId":"72057645577625111","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Please. We don't use that word. The term is \"mentally damaged beyond repair\" by the therapy you received.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please. We don't use that word. The term is \"mentally damaged beyond repair\" by the therapy you received.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1750.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43007","byteOffset":30600232,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_46430DE2","articyId":"72057645577625131","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Yes! You're nuttier than a fruit loaf. A nutty one. I know that's not a socially acceptable way to say you're fucking mental, but... you know what you are.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes! You're nuttier than a fruit loaf. A nutty one. I know that's not a socially acceptable way to say you're fucking mental, but... you know what you are.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2650.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32596","byteOffset":20214896,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_02C9875B","articyId":"72057645577625136","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Sadly, no. Why did you have to be so fucking stable? You live in Nivalis. NIVALIS! Even the people who are happy have lost touch with reality. Obviously.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sadly, no. Why did you have to be so fucking stable? You live in Nivalis. NIVALIS! Even the people who are happy have lost touch with reality. Obviously.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2650.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38770","byteOffset":28999840,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_817210FE","articyId":"72057645577625166","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"You really are, you glorious, mad bastard.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You really are, you glorious, mad bastard.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27399","byteOffset":18246712,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_4FF62B4C","articyId":"72057645577625171","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"You played the role perfectly.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You played the role perfectly.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17320","byteOffset":14441376,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_393FB875","articyId":"72057645577625176","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"That's what we were shooting for.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's what we were shooting for.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32241","byteOffset":20077504,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_33BA8AE5","articyId":"72057645577625196","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"I'm free. I'm finally free. The Sanguine Minds Project voided my contract. I've been told to deny all knowledge of their existence. I'm out!","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm free. I'm finally free. The Sanguine Minds Project voided my contract. I've been told to deny all knowledge of their existence. I'm out!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24165","byteOffset":17020272,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_8595E0BC","articyId":"72057645577625210","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"I used to advise small business start-ups. Game companies, zine publishing, hyper pop star training camps. My name is mud now... unless I change it.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I used to advise small business start-ups. Game companies, zine publishing, hyper pop star training camps. My name is mud now... unless I change it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4475.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42218","byteOffset":30299952,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_41F95666","articyId":"72057645577625224","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Hey, I like that! What kind of Alfie should I be? Give me a new name. Something catchy, that screams \"Fresh start\".","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, I like that! What kind of Alfie should I be? Give me a new name. Something catchy, that screams \"Fresh start\".","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5075.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30448","byteOffset":19400136,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_A6E18C19","articyId":"72057645577625252","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Alfie Gunfibel","text":"Hey, I like it! Thanks. I mean it. When my new business takes off, I won't forget this.","speakerId":"Ntt_B75F0339","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, I like it! Thanks. I mean it. When my new business takes off, I won't forget this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5675.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40505","byteOffset":29651736,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_2F403C94"